  "title": "Stuffed Cod Wrapped in Bacon",
  "description": "Cod fillets are seasoned with sesame oil and chili sauce, then filled with leek and mushroom before being wrapped in bacon and quickly grilled. An easy, different way to grill fish fillets and make people think you slaved all day.",
  "authors": [
    "BRADYSMOM17"
